&_nc_oc=Adp-uR5OgwSsU1iG7kLngHQ7qM9PY8jBpK0UB3yQfRvDlSmK4ia5ED9PxApEJkNe9FU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSocGIt79o1BMJoAvgv1CVeCH9TKfn_2RHl4EidgFsS_w&oe=6AF3353E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gZf0QlnnQFcQ7kNvwFBEZP5&_nc_oc=AdrDfLD0_JCohTlEMaUWQKLdrZbu-N0A6ldrOB5PsjM0l1x9uI23olyc7RFXEmGl9FE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQNzOGj75BvE2UCzdc2AyDNkp4I74VbjkQUmIF3YN1bOw&oe=6AF3463C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n6FvGtfwkvsQ7kNvwFFaWrQ&_nc_oc=AdrqtrW8Zmx938sqMWUzsCx-kO1e4TGhbmsENKTUIx4vlM_YqC9GpMbEfYBitffDMMc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRSWUCBOsK04dUM6eH5TWpppRD_NqfXnNi_jWzgTCrMIQ&oe=6AF32C87"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5bQouWTyAXQQ7kNvwH-N2Zk&_nc_oc=AdothjrAAW818-ZOY9xQRg9ezE9ENGMa_EB9ku3jQ4-g7E-2i1gJHdV6RvE6vA2xQgA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSyrAadNsWoaX8l29gvUxiW1W5835vGoGKqHkZy9yX64w&oe=6AF35095"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GSL-nK0-UQ0Q7kNvwGQo9GI&_nc_oc=AdokmNiw4wVSAUd6sme6d961Sn1VljL8qpKnKxImkcVaVuIvosuyyd3tR_x-KNTG8tI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTDOQzpPf3Qs-uH2XFN7dAV5kNnVO74FXQt4jRaxxpIDg&oe=6AF324E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.